    <question_explanation no="16" id="PRB-2DA82589E1DC526F-Q16">
      <question_stem>피치가 9 mm인 한 줄 사각나사가 있다. 마찰계수가 0.15일 때, 나사의 자립조건을 만족하는 최소 유효지름[mm]은? (단, π ＝ 3이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>피치</keyword>
        <keyword>사각나사</keyword>
        <keyword>있다</keyword>
        <keyword>마찰계수</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>20</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 기계설계 · 사각나사의 자립조건
정답은 ③이다. 자립조건 μ ≥ tanα = p/(πd)에서 d ≥ p/(πμ) = 9 ÷ (3 × 0.15) = 20 mm이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>12</choice_text>
          <commentary>12 mm이면 리드각이 커서 자립하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>16</choice_text>
          <commentary>16 mm이면 자립하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>20</choice_text>
          <commentary>최소 유효지름 20 mm이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>24</choice_text>
          <commentary>24 mm는 최소가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
