    <question_explanation no="17" id="PRB-2DA82589E1DC526F-Q17">
      <question_stem>원형 중실축이 2,400 Nㆍmm의 굽힘모멘트를 받고 있을 때 축의 지름[mm]은? (단, 축의 허용굽힘응력은 64 MPa이고, π ＝ 3이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>원형</keyword>
        <keyword>중실축</keyword>
        <keyword>굽힘모멘트</keyword>
        <keyword>받고</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$\sqrt[3]{400}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 기계설계 · 굽힘모멘트를 받는 축의 지름
정답은 ④이다. σ = 32M/(πd³)이므로 d³ = 32 × 2,400 ÷ (3 × 64) = 76,800 ÷ 192 = 400이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\sqrt[3]{50}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>∛50은 계산 결과와 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\sqrt[3]{100}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>∛100은 계산 결과와 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\sqrt[3]{200}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>∛200은 계수를 16으로 한 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$\sqrt[3]{400}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>d = ∛400 mm이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
